    <summary>Real-time CPS (clicks per second) tracker using a low-level mouse hook, with peak, average and a history chart.</summary>
    <description>**License: proprietary freeware.** ClickMeter is free for personal, non-commercial use only. Any business, organizational or client use (companies, sole traders, non-profits, and agencies or contractors working for clients) needs a separate commercial license from TAPATCH before use. Full terms: https://tapatch.com/terms/software/

ClickMeter tracks your click rate in real time with no overhead. It counts every click straight from a low-level mouse hook, so nothing slips past — even rapid or injected bursts that browser-based testers miss. Track left, right, or middle clicks, alone or combined. Live CPS updates instantly, peak and session average stay visible, and a configurable history chart shows anywhere from the last 30 seconds up to your full session. Tiny binary, zero telemetry, entirely local.

## Features
- **Live CPS** - Clicks per second updates in real time. No delay, no averaging lag — the number you see is the number you're hitting.
- **Counts every click** - A low-level mouse hook catches each individual click — physical, automated, or injected. Even rapid batched bursts that browser testers miss are counted accurately.
- **L / R / M tracking** - Count left, right, and middle clicks independently or together. Per-button breakdown shows current CPS and lifetime totals.
- **Peak + session average** - Tracks your highest CPS burst and rolling session average across every tracked button.
- **Configurable history** - Bar chart window: full session, last 30s, 60s, 2 min, 5 min, or a custom duration you dial in yourself.
- **Zero measuring overhead** - The hook runs on its own dedicated thread and never steals keyboard focus, so it doesn't slow down — or interfere with — whatever you're testing.
- **Theme presets + custom** - Tapatch, Neon, Arctic, Ember, Void, and a full custom theme editor with live preview.

## Notes
- Free for personal use. Business or commercial use requires a paid license (see https://tapatch.com/terms/software/).
- Windows 10/11, 64-bit. Runs fully locally; no ads, no telemetry, no bundled offers.
- Available in 10 languages: English, Chinese (Simplified), Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese, French, Polish and Korean.
- The Terms of Service are shown on first launch and must be accepted to use the app.
</description>
    <releaseNotes>- Background pictures and GIFs: add as many as you like in Settings, tick the ones to show (or Select all), and the ticked ones take turns
- Sliders set how strong the picture is and how see-through the panels are; turn it off any time
- No longer crashes when opened within 35 seconds of Windows starting
- Much lighter on the PC: it redraws 4 times a second while no one is clicking instead of 125 (a click wakes it right away)
- Custom colors no longer come back one shade darker, and the donation pop-up is centered
- The installer's license text matches the current Terms, and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt lists the open-source parts it uses

Full changelog: https://tapatch.com/tools/clickmeter/</releaseNotes>
